  'Month-end is not slow because of the accounting. It is slow because of four days of pulling, matching, chasing and formatting before anyone qualified sees a number.':
    'texte2c604d8e8f9',
  'Most of the queue is not modelling. It is the fourth version of a question already asked, a pipeline that broke overnight, and three teams disagreeing on what "active" means.':
    'textb83b8a3e405c',
