  never: 'text6497e4b3d7be',
  'No ranking, no scoring, no automated rejection, no recommendation dressed as a summary. The jobs on this page are scheduling, drafting, assembling and answering. If you want an agent to screen candidates, that is a decision you are making about your hiring process — and it is not what this page is selling you.':
    'textc93198d9d71e',
  'Nobody joined a sales team to update a CRM. But the pipeline is only as good as the data in it, and the data is only as good as the last hour someone spent on admin.':
    'text41e2441de955',
  'Northwind Logistics': 'textc4f714005c5b',
  'Not the rewrites. The small, well-defined work underneath them: reproductions, dependency bumps, flaky tests, a rename across two hundred files.':
    'text1138f40d47a7',
  'Nothing goes to a customer without a yes.': 'textb131d7f95b08',
  'Nothing merges itself.': 'texte0cda358fedf',
